{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46953","headline":"寄南岳诸道友 · 齐己","name":"寄南岳诸道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南望衡阳积瘴开，去年曾踏雪游回。\n谩爲楚客蹉跎过，却是边鸿的当来。\n乳窦孤明含海日，石桥危滑长春苔。\n终寻十八高人去，共坐苍崖养圣胎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}